# Modelfile for Agents-A1 (Claude-Code-ready). Produced by install-model.sh.
#
# FROM points at a GGUF whose chat template has had the two tool-parser-breaking guards removed
# ("System message must be at the beginning", "No user query found in messages") while keeping the
# model's native Qwen3-Coder XML tool format and <think> reasoning. See ../README.md.
#
# Sampling params are Agents-A1's card recommendations. num_ctx is raised from Ollama's small default.
FROM ./Agents-A1-Q4_K_M-fixed.gguf
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0.85
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.1
